Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:03.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}What if a whale swallowed you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.96,0:00:05.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You dive in calm water.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.97,0:00:09.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}A dark shadow rises from below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.08,0:00:12.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}A giant mouth opens around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.75,0:00:14.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.89,0:00:16.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.59,0:00:18.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Total darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.29,0:00:20.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Water crushes in from every side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.83,0:00:23.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You can't tell up from down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.91,0:00:25.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:28.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The pressure squeezes your chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.05,0:00:29.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your mask is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:32.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your air is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.87,0:00:34.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After thirty seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.64,0:00:37.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You think this is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.77,0:00:39.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}But here's the twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.75,0:00:44.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}In twenty twenty-one, this happened to a lobster diver near Cape Cod.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.73,0:00:48.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}A humpback whale scooped him up by accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.06,0:00:51.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}About thirty seconds later, it spat him back out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:53.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}He survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.09,0:00:57.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}A humpback's throat is far too narrow to swallow a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.93,0:00:59.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}So remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.29,0:01:00.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You're not on the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.90,0:01:02.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Just in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:05.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Would you still swim with whales?
